00:25:03.920 --> 00:25:05.230
So you don't have a left flux.

00:25:05.230 --> 00:25:07.120
That's equilibrium.

00:25:07.120 --> 00:25:12.400
And if you look at the
simplest form of a solution

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:17.710
