00:25:35.240 --> 00:25:41.060
So what really is giving
the flux is the deviation,

00:25:41.060 --> 00:25:42.800
this term is given the flux.

00:25:42.800 --> 00:25:45.820
F0 does not give you the flux.

00:25:45.820 --> 00:25:50.780
So if I plot f itself in the
