00:53:45.930 --> 00:53:53.820
I have g equals s0 and
exponential minus y V cosine

00:53:53.820 --> 00:53:57.750
theta minus 1.

00:53:57.750 --> 00:54:02.310
And cosine theta is also
called directional cosine.

00:54:02.310 --> 00:54:06.310
Mu equals directional
cosine theta.

00:54:06.310 --> 00:54:09.640
So that's just a symbol.

00:54:09.640 --> 00:54:11.850
So I can write in
terms of mu rather than

00:54:11.850 --> 00:54:16.000
