00:54:16.000 --> 00:54:21.370
OK, so this is for y equals 0.

00:54:21.370 --> 00:54:24.820
And similarly, you look
at the upper plane,

00:54:24.820 --> 00:54:30.670
you say g equals again s0.

00:54:30.670 --> 00:54:35.500
And the exponential,
if I look at this,

00:54:35.500 --> 00:54:41.800
will be d minus y gamma--

00:54:41.800 --> 00:54:45.520
oh, did I miss a tau?

00:54:45.520 --> 00:54:47.110
