00:54:54.750 --> 00:54:56.710
So write an extra equation.

00:54:56.710 --> 00:55:14.490
Tau y tau dg dy plus g equals
minus tau Vx df0 dT dT dx.

00:55:14.490 --> 00:55:15.660
So I put a g--

00:55:15.660 --> 00:55:18.120
so this is a tau.

00:55:18.120 --> 00:55:19.110
I have tau.

00:55:19.110 --> 00:55:20.850
So that should be at tau.

00:55:20.850 --> 00:55:25.240
Tau times V is mean free path.

00:55:25.240 --> 00:55:28.180
OK, so tau times V
is a mean free path.

00:55:28.180 --> 00:55:34.210
And divide that
by mu and minus 1.

00:55:34.210 --> 00:55:39.220
And this is a for theta is
