00:56:03.210 --> 00:56:04.770
So this is always--

00:56:04.770 --> 00:56:10.290
it's from surface it
decays, surface it decays.

00:56:10.290 --> 00:56:13.400
That's how I decide my sign.

00:56:13.400 --> 00:56:16.320
Physical, you can think
about in physical terms.

00:56:19.160 --> 00:56:23.130
OK, so I have the
solution for g.

00:56:23.130 --> 00:56:29.370
That means I know my f,
because the f is f0 plus g.

00:56:29.370 --> 00:56:32.340
So once I know f, I
can go to find out

00:56:32.340 --> 00:56:33.585
